  "question": {
    "text": "Two numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> are chosen simultaneously from the set of integers&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>39</mn></math>, then the probability that the equation <math><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is satisfied is",
